# Her Memories: Carnelian Footfalls (crystalWar 69) with allegiance 2 (no flow statement sets one: the char completes
# The Fighting Fourth at Adelbrecht as Azure's flow does). A level 99 Warrior in Bastok Markets [S] with the WotG
# mission Her Memories current and the Red Recommendation Letter. East Ronfaure [S], then Southern San d'Oria [S] from
# there at Prog 0: no zone-in reply (Carnelian needs allegiance 1).
lists BastokMarketsS/Adelbrecht/onTrigger SouthernSanDoriaS/onZoneIn/1
char zone=BastokMarketsS pos=-324.266,-12.601,-76.977 job=WAR lvl=99
keyitem RedRecommendationLetter
mission Wotg HerMemories current
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
login
trigger Adelbrecht                      # The Fighting Fourth: the letter: 139 (0, 0)
finish option=1                         # begun
charvar Quest[7][7]Prog 3               # a GM
trigger Adelbrecht                      # 143
finish                                  # completed; allegiance 2
warp 314.321,-30.495,-67.15 EastRonfaureS
warp -13.849,1.398,-30.368 SouthernSanDoriaS # from East Ronfaure [S], allegiance 2: no zone-in reply (needs 1)
